WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.440
I'm Vlad, founder of USATII Media. We treat the word media literally—as the systems through which an organization operates, communicates, and creates value.

00:09.440 --> 00:19.520
Our mission is to reduce a company to the smallest sufficient set of software capabilities needed to unify your operations or fulfill marketing deliverables.

00:19.520 --> 00:30.640
I actually started the company when I was editing content and managing social media for hundreds of creators across Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, and Reddit. That experience exposed a really big problem.

00:30.640 --> 00:40.880
Organizations accumulate disconnected tools, repetitive workflows, scattered data, and processes that depend too heavily on individual effort. Editing takes hours. If you've never edited before, that's a lot.

00:40.880 --> 00:56.240
My background in artificial intelligence, software engineering, cybersecurity, and media led me to a different model. Software should make rote work structurally unnecessary while allowing creativity and flexibility that produce exceptional results.

00:56.240 --> 01:06.400
For marketing, that may mean auditing the organization or the creator's existing stack and building a consistent operating pipeline across channels, including creating real content.

01:06.400 --> 01:16.720
For a company that wants to scale operations, it may mean constructing an ontology of your business—identifying every important entity, workflow, dependency, and decision—and then designing a unified suite of features around how your organization actually works.
